Subject: [PATCH] game/fft: the widescreen cut set for 1.5.1 (1920x888, both
 pools, the wide-viewport clamp)

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: this fork's purpose is native aspect and resolution; the cuts are the consumer-verified widescreen route for FINAL FANTASY TACTICS 1.5.1 (render pair 1920x888, the vn graphics and swapchain pool gates, the wide-viewport clamp), all asserted against the real 1.5.1 NSO. Upstream's profile stays 16:9 and brought up on 1.4.0 (see 0069)
Issue: seedds/nxnative#3046 (the 1.5.1 registration the cuts extend), seedds/nxnative#3033 (the rendered-pair precedent, handheld 1080p / iPhone Duo native aspect)

